h `@returns $this` which at least gets my build passing again.\r\n\r\nPersonally, I don't want to have to annotate that - that's kinda my intention of adding the return type. But, I imagine there's probably a deeper consideration of the PHP type system that I'm not aware of that causes us to have to annotate this. Either way, I would love to understand why this is the case (or if it is not intended).\r\n\r\nCheers!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/829/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]